### プロジェクト一覧取得
GET http://localhost:8080/project?userId=1
Content-Type:application/json


### プロジェクト登録
POST http://localhost:8080/project/
Content-Type:application/json

{
    "userId": 1, 
    "title": "Finish the tutorial on Quarkus framework",
    "registerDate": "2024-06-20",
    "detailList": [
        {
            "taskName": "Read the official documentation"
        },
        {
            "taskName": "Write some example code"
        },
        {
            "taskName": "Build a small project"
        }
    ]
}

### プロジェクト削除
DELETE http://localhost:8080/project/1
Content-Type:application/json
